# fixtures/hex/store-b/seg.d3.hex: store B's delta segment, the only layer of its main set: rows #1-#7 (#2
# lives only on the deleted lane/x, so its row is absent: kind 0, all zero), the live run-scoped lease, ALLOC
# with the holes of the reservation's ids #8-#9, SCHEMAIDS with the reserved kind id 64, and FILES with
# cs.1 marked `reserved` (its bulk commit never lands). The five derived-optional caches are absent.

